      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for the draft. I noticed the \"Purpose\" section says the goal is to ensure the agency remains inclusive \"by prohibiting political speech.\" \n\nSome of the department heads are worried that a blanket prohibition might be seen as silencing certain perspectives or being too restrictive on personal rights. Can you expand on the reasoning here? Why is prohibiting speech the best way to ensure inclusivity rather than just managing how it happens?",
